{"id":"n75649-4-7","stage":4,"title":"정통 · 正中","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n75649-4-7-1","ko":"괜찮아? 어디 다치진 않았니?","zh":"你没事吧？没受伤吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"괜찮아?","meaning":"无恙，没事","explanation":"괜찮다：无恙，没事；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"괜찮다","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60097","senseId":"2","lemma":"괜찮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"괜찮아","audio":"/audio/87dea6f32ecb5a9bbac8.mp3"}},{"text":"어디","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}},{"text":"다치진","meaning":"受伤，负伤，弄伤","explanation":"다치다：受伤，负伤，弄伤；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"다치다","audio":"/audio/128510caa5a5a0b67924.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73400","senseId":"1","lemma":"다치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다치진","audio":"/audio/4d279661e70eccdd306c.mp3"}},{"text":"않았니?","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71583","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않았니","audio":"/audio/779844dd4334d4e835f6.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"b9a2699f824000e3","term":"괜찮다","zh":"无恙，没事","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3","entryId":"60097","definition":"没有特别的问题。","pronunciation":["괜찬타"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"128510caa5a5a0b6","term":"다치다","zh":"受伤，负伤，弄伤","audio":"/audio/128510caa5a5a0b67924.mp3","entryId":"73400","definition":"被撞到或被打后身上或身体的一部分出现伤口；或指使出现伤口。","pronunciation":["다치다"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71583","definition":"用于否定前文所指的状态。","pronunciation":["안타"]}],"audio":"/audio/93faf628afe2e2b28f71.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n75649-4-7-2","ko":"얼굴을 정통으로 맞아서 너무 아파.","zh":"脸被直接打中了，疼死了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"얼굴을","meaning":"脸，面孔，脸部","explanation":"얼굴：脸，面孔，脸部；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"얼굴","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17183","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼굴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼굴을","audio":"/audio/0cce198792a151b686e8.mp3"}},{"text":"정통으로","meaning":"正中","explanation":"정통：正中；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"정통","audio":"/audio/558be6cc360cce64bb1d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75649","senseId":"4","lemma":"정통","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정통으로","audio":"/audio/334312f257846e3881eb.mp3"}},{"text":"맞아서","meaning":"被打，挨打","explanation":"맞다：被打，挨打；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66233","senseId":"1","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맞아서","audio":"/audio/585a35eca0344181c422.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"아파.","meaning":"疼， 痛，不舒服","explanation":"아프다：疼， 痛，不舒服；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"아프다","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62239","senseId":"1","lemma":"아프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아파","audio":"/audio/f1eadb220a21e78bc17f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"886ae927b512e2e4","term":"얼굴","zh":"脸，面孔，脸部","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3","entryId":"17183","definition":"有眼睛、鼻子、嘴的头的前面部分。","pronunciation":["얼굴"]},{"id":"558be6cc360cce64","term":"정통","zh":"正中","audio":"/audio/558be6cc360cce64bb1d.mp3","entryId":"75649","definition":"没有一点偏差、正好。","pronunciation":["정ː통"]},{"id":"6d08580e9b088153","term":"맞다","zh":"被打，挨打","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3","entryId":"66233","definition":"被施加某种外力而身体受到伤害，甚至感到疼痛。","pronunciation":["맏따"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"912c6f176a189a34","term":"아프다","zh":"疼， 痛，不舒服","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3","entryId":"62239","definition":"因受伤或生病，而感到痛症或痛苦。","pronunciation":["아프다"]}],"audio":"/audio/20df5091c83eff686c00.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.633,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=75649","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"4","sourceLevel":"고급","day":129,"sequenceScore":2.4597,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你没事吧？没受伤吧？","脸被直接打中了，疼死了。","好像哪儿有烟花的声音？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你没事吧？没受伤吧？","脸被直接打中了，疼死了。","好像哪儿有烟花的声音？"],"answer":1}]}
